G2822.def:
**κλητός**, -ή, -όν
(καλέω), [in LXX for קָרָא, מִקְרָא, [[Exo.12.16|Exo.12:16]], al. ;]
called, invited (as to a banquet, Æsch., [[1Sa.1.41|1Sa 1:41]], [[3Ma.5.14|3Ma.5:14]]); in NT, always of the Divine call;
(a) **to some office**: κ. ἀπόστολος, [[Rom.1.1|Rom.1:1]], [[1Co.1.1|1Co.1:1]];
(b) **to salvation**: [[Rom.8.28|Rom.8:28]], [[1Co.1.24|1Co.1:24]], [[Jude.1|Ju 1]]; κ. καὶ ἐκλεκτοὶ κ. πιστοί, [[Rev.17.14|Rev.17:14]] in gosp. (not in pl., see: καλέω) disting. fr.ἐκλεκτός, [[Mat.20.16|Mat.20:16]] (WH, txt., R, omit), [[Mat.22.14|Mat.22:14]] κ. Ἰησοῦ Χρ., [[Rom.1.6|Rom.1:6]] κ. ἅγιοι, saints by calling, [[Rom.1.7|Rom.1:7]], [[1Co.1.2|1Co.1:2]].†
(AS)
